---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Contact Panta — book a free 20-minute call"
  description="Tell us what's not working about your online presence. We reply within one business day — because response speed is one of the things we audit."
>
  <section class="section section--dark" style="padding-block: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem);">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="label">Contact</p>
      <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 3.2rem);">Tell us what's not working.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        A free 20-minute call, no pitch. If the audit isn't the right move for
        you, we'll say so — and you'll still leave with something useful.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid grid--2" style="gap: 3rem; align-items: start;">
        <div>
          <!-- TODO(deploy): wire action to a form backend (Formspree/Resend) before launch -->
          <form class="form-grid" method="post" action="#">
            <div>
              <label for="name">Your name</label>
              <input type="text" id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="org">Organization</label>
              <input type="text" id="org" name="org" autocomplete="organization" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input type="email" id="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="message">What made you reach out now?</label>
              <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="5" placeholder="The itch. A form nobody fills out, a listing with the wrong hours, a hunch you're invisible on Google…"></textarea>
            </div>
            <div>
              <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary">Send it over</button>
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="label">Or just email</p>
          <p style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.5rem;">
            <a href="mailto:hello@panta.co">hello@panta.co</a>
          </p>
          <hr class="divider" />
          <p class="label">What happens next</p>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>We reply within one business day. Response speed is one of the things we audit — so we model it.</li>
            <li>We'll schedule a free 20-minute call to hear what's going on.</li>
            <li>If the audit fits, we'll send the intake questionnaire and get started. If it doesn't, we'll point you somewhere useful.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
